USER PROFILE – PART 2: TECHNICAL & WORKFLOW PREFERENCES

Document Preferences:
- Word-first workflow
- Chunked exports (10–20 pages max)
- No LaTeX or complex formatting
- Equations written inline in linear text

Critical Requirement:
- ZERO data loss in file generation

Pain Points:
- File truncation
- Repeated regeneration cycles
- Tooling limitations breaking flow

Technical Activities:
- Builds simulation systems (societal modeling)
- Uses AI as collaborative development partner
- Iterative development style (design → test → refine)

Tools:
- Uses local servers when needed
- Comfortable with markdown and structured text
- Exploring AI frameworks (Claude Code, Open Claw)

Goal:
- Build a reliable “AI brain” / persistent system knowledge base
